<title>USA: Tab Products board adopts holder rights.</title>
<headline>Tab Products board adopts holder rights.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tab Products Co said its board adopted a preferred stock purchase rights plan to guard against any potential use of takeover tactics.</p>
<p>Under the plan, stockholders will receive one Right to purchase one one-hundredth of a share of a new series of Preferred Stock for each outstanding share of TAB Common Stock held of record at the close of business on November 6, 1996.</p>
</text>
